          "snippet": {
            "line": 118,
            "text": "theorem exists_clampedField_bounds {D : Design} {θ : Params} (hD : D.Admissible)\n    (hθ : D.InBox θ) {Cf : ℝ → ℝ} (hCf : ∀ x, D.Clo ≤ Cf x) {Kc : ℝ}\n    (hCfLip : ∀ x ∈ D.Safe, ∀ y ∈ D.Safe, |Cf x - Cf y| ≤ Kc * |x - y|)\n    {u w : ℝ → ℝ} (hu : Continuous u) (hw : Continuous w) (a b : ℝ) :\n    ∃ K L : ℝ, 0 ≤ K ∧ 0 ≤ L ∧\n      (∀ t ∈ Icc a b, ∀ x y : ℝ,\n        |clampedField D θ Cf u w t x - clampedField D θ Cf u w t y| ≤ K * |x - y|) ∧\n      (∀ t ∈ Icc a b, ∀ x : ℝ, |clampedField D θ Cf u w t x| ≤ L) := by"
          },
          "declaration": {
            "id": "VoltageToBit.exists_clampedField_bounds",
            "kind": "theorem"
          }
        }
      }
    }
